{"_id":"6a2ff9982204ffbc59e5a797","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"Md9Yq7bwDNo6hO_A9aa9N","description":"# Matplotlib\n\nMatplotlib is Python's foundational plotting library. It provides a MATLAB-like interface for creating static, animated, and interactive visualizations. While more verbose than higher-level libraries, Matplotlib offers the most control over every aspect of a plot and is the basis for understanding how other Python visualization tools work.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Matplotlib Tutorials","url":"https://matplotlib.org/stable/tutorials/index.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb84"},{"type":"article","title":"Matplotlib Tutorial","url":"https://www.w3schools.com/python/matplotlib_intro.asp","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb85"},{"type":"video","title":"Matplotlib Full Python Course - Data Science Fundamentals","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OZOOLe2imFo","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb86"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:09:44.039Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/Md9Yq7bwDNo6hO_A9aa9N.md"}